  m_Name: Mimi the Nerdy NPC - Quest - Find Siss & Still needs Silly
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1964226d4f853d248af65a60e0a53924, type: 2}
    textENG: "Ah\u2026 yes, you\u2019ve interacted with Mimi the Mystic. Well done."
    textPL: "Ah\u2026 tak, skonsultowa\u0142e\u015B si\u0119 z Mimi the Mystic. Dobrze."
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1964226d4f853d248af65a60e0a53924, type: 2}
    textENG: "But\u2026 wait! You still haven\u2019t consulted the silly one.\r\nProceed,
      or the sequence remains unresolved."
    textPL: "Ale\u2026 chwileczk\u0119! Nadal nie rozmawia\u0142e\u015B z tym g\u0142uptasem.\r\nId\u017A
      dalej, inaczej sekwencja pozostanie niekompletna."
    expressionName: 
